WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:03.137
You close the shop, but the counting is not finished.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:04.913
What is missing?

00:00:05.775 --> 00:00:06.913
What is piling up?

00:00:07.775 --> 00:00:09.088
What needs your attention?

00:00:10.387 --> 00:00:13.775
Friendly one two three gives every product a color, so you can

00:00:13.787 --> 00:00:14.975
see what to do next.

00:00:16.274 --> 00:00:17.299
Green is healthy.

00:00:18.174 --> 00:00:19.837
Gold shows an opportunity.

00:00:20.712 --> 00:00:22.174
Orange means check soon.

00:00:23.037 --> 00:00:24.249
Red means urgent.

00:00:25.112 --> 00:00:27.012
Black means your stock is sleeping.

00:00:28.301 --> 00:00:29.564
Record your sales.

00:00:30.426 --> 00:00:32.239
Review your stock and commissions.

00:00:33.101 --> 00:00:36.439
Keep the daily record together, and use the dashboard to see your

00:00:36.451 --> 00:00:37.601
business at a glance.

00:00:38.919 --> 00:00:41.131
Try every feature free for thirty days.

00:00:41.994 --> 00:00:45.794
Then, three hundred ninety nine dollars buys a five year license.

00:00:46.656 --> 00:00:48.019
No monthly payments.

00:00:49.316 --> 00:00:50.266
Open the demo.

00:00:51.141 --> 00:00:52.141
No signup.

00:00:53.003 --> 00:00:53.828
No card.

00:00:54.691 --> 00:00:56.191
Friendly one two three.

00:00:57.066 --> 00:00:58.628
Your business, in color.
